      "id": "2092670516964270101",
      "text": "Run Qwen3.8-Flash-Next on your @NVIDIAAI 2x DGX Sparks with ease ✨\n\n- 900k context with Vision\n- SGLang, MTP, SM121 kernel patch\n- Stress tested with 300k tokens prefill\n\n~64 tok/s single stream (structural)\n~115 tok/s for 2-4 concurrent sessions\n\nConservative settings. Can probably be pushed further. Full decode numbers in the post below.\n\nGet it here:\nhttps://t.co/e4WwEShocx",
